  "about": "Starting looks. Eight colour tokens, three faces, all faces OFL and shipped in looks/fonts. A look is picked by name in the concept round; a comp written against the tokens switches by name. Roles: ground is the 70 % of the frame, deep a second ground (vignette, far plane), card surfaces on the ground, line hairlines, mute secondary labels (>= 3:1 on ground), ink type and subject (>= 4.5:1), accent the one colour that means something, accent2 its rare partner.",
